	</choice>
</event>
<event name="STORAGE_CHECK_SYSTEM_OE_GREASE_EFFECT_SHLEG">
	<text>You have tech on your ship which can be scanned by your Weapons Amplifier.
[Inculcation Enhancement: Causes the last projectile in the volley to create inculcation gas on hit.]
It will take a while to scan, giving the fleet time to catch up. Proceed?</text>
