<event name="STORAGE_CHECK_SYSTEM_OE_GREASE_EFFECT_BIRD">
	<text>You have tech on your ship which can be scanned by your Weapons Amplifier.
[Marked Enhancement: Causes the last projectile in the volley to target all friendly drones on hit.]
It will take a while to scan, giving the fleet time to catch up. Proceed?</text>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Proceed.</text>
		<event>
			<text>Your system scans the technology, adding the enhancement to the system's library.</text>
			<modifyPursuit amount="1"/>
			<hiddenAug>OE_GREASE_EFFECT_BIRD</hiddenAug>
